## The explanation levels: names and audiences.

level-novice-name = First steps
level-novice-audience = ≈10–13 years: what happens and why, no formulas
level-school-name = Core
level-school-audience = ≈13–15 years: formulas, meaning of every quantity, real numbers
level-advanced-name = In depth
level-advanced-audience = ≈15–18 years: laws, who found them, where they stop working
level-expert-name = Expert
level-expert-audience = teachers, olympiad students: numerics, data provenance, sources
